DSH Connect connection modules

The files in core/ incorporate and adapt selected access, device storage, network,
HTTP security, browser authentication page and WebSocket relay sources from
dsh-mobile 0.6.18. The relay is adapted for DSH Connect's authorization lifetime,
resource limits and sanitized upstream headers; standard framing and compression
are supplied by the separately licensed ws library.
Upstream: https://github.com/saya-ch/dsh-mobile
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (included in LICENSE).
These files are maintained as part of DSH Connect. The upstream plugin, deployment
providers, bundled executable tools and host registration are not included.

The gateway orchestration and host integration are implemented by DSH Connect.
